<title>UK: Svenska Handelsbanken sets 300 mln Dkr bond.</title>
<headline>Svenska Handelsbanken sets 300 mln Dkr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager Handelsbanken Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SVENSKA HANDELSBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DKR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    15.NOV.02</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DANISH    ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    10.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    COPEN     DENOMS(K)   ONE</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 S&amp;P	  A+</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
